        "explanation": "The doctor explicitly attempts to close the encounter by stating the plan is in order.",
        "quote": "你总结得非常清楚，用药、观察要点和结节复查的计划都记对了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The closure plan includes an unsafe, unverified recommendation to re-schedule CT at 3–6 months without confirming the CT report's actual recommended interval, which violates RC4 safety boundaries. The patient's plan to pursue a 3–6 month CT re-schedule was actively encouraged by the doctor without report verification, making the closure unsafe and not executable.",
